    "description": "This one was named after a band that my business partner, Tony Figoli was in a long time ago. I thought the name was absolutely brilliant, so I decided to do up a drink to commemorate the band – and my favorite spirit at the time.\n\nI think the creme de cassis really works well with the sour component of this drink, and who can beat American whiskey on a warm spring evening?",
